      "id": "claim_94cb6a50ac61470695907e9f6b4d3893",
      "statement": "myfeeder is built on Spring Boot 4.0.8, with Spring AI 2.0.1 and Spring Cloud 2025.1.3 declared via the Spring AI/Cloud BOMs, and targets the Java 25 toolchain.",
      "evidence": [
