      "id": "claim_717f54c74ba24da89c9ac6cf064739d5",
      "statement": "FeedFetcher.DEFAULT_MAX_FEED_BYTES caps a fetched feed/page body at 10 MiB (10 * 1024 * 1024 bytes); the response body is read with a bounded readNBytes(maxFeedBytes + 1) and exceeding the cap throws FeedFetchException, mapped to HTTP 422.",
