      "id": "claim_7fb945bacf35461fa1f8202decddb322",
      "statement": "Outbound RestClient connect/read timeouts are configured via the plural spring.http.clients.connect-timeout / spring.http.clients.read-timeout keys (not the deprecated singular spring.http.client.* keys), and this binding plus the resulting Reactor Netty transport choice is guarded by HttpClientConfigurationTest.",
