    {
      "id": "claim_36a8c790dbe449fdb65a56c1df701880",
      "statement": "reactor-netty-http is declared as an explicit Gradle dependency because Spring AI 2.0.1 no longer pulls it in transitively; without it, Boot's auto-configuration would silently fall back to the JDK HttpClient transport for outbound RestClient calls, a regression HttpClientConfigurationTest.outboundTransportIsReactorNetty() specifically guards against.",
